This product contains no third-party code.

The visual design of the look and feel in src/main/java/dev/restclient/ui/laf/
(flat controls, rounded fields and buttons, slim scroll bars, light and dark palettes)
was inspired by FlatLaf (https://www.formdev.com/flatlaf/, Apache License 2.0) and by
Apple's Human Interface Guidelines. No source code from FlatLaf was copied; the
implementation was written independently on top of Swing's Basic look and feel.
